EMBEDDED THIRD-PARTY CODE

The AAR artifacts built from this subtree embed the JAB Code codec as native
libraries:

    jni/arm64-v8a/libjabcode-mobile.so
    jni/armeabi-v7a/libjabcode-mobile.so
    jni/x86_64/libjabcode-mobile.so

Those are MIT-licensed (Fraunhofer SIT and Kendall Fleming) and their notice
MUST accompany every copy of the AAR. See NOTICE in this directory, which is
packaged into the AAR.
